ter-sale-banner-22.jpg\"Invitation to Collaborate – Amazing Sales Startup Booster – Mehrdad Website\n<h2>📌 Invitation to Collaborate, Recruitment, Networking, Investment for Amazing Sales Startup Booster!</h2>\n<h4>💡 Given the unfavorable economic conditions in Iran and the decrease in people's purchasing power, as the Sales Startup Booster, we have designed a new plan to increase the sale of goods and services in online and offline stores. 🚀</h4>\n<h4>🔸 By using tested and researched marketing and sales ideas, we help sellers increase their sales. 💰</h4>\n<h4>🌐 Additionally, we intend to bring offline sellers into the online market to boost sales and provide innovative services. 📈</h4>\n<h4>🏢 This system helps small and large stores, but larger stores like Digikala, Snapp, Torob, and BIZPAL will welcome it more. 👏</h4>\n<h4>🔑 If you are interested in collaborating and investing in Amazing Sales Startup Booster, don't miss this opportunity! 🤝</h4>\n<p> </p>\nsrc=\"/media/booster-3.jpg\"Amazing Sales Startup Booster – Mehrdad Website\n<h5>For a more detailed explanation to learn more, please contact us</h5>\n<h4>Considering the economic conditions in Iran and the decrease in people's purchasing power, sales opportunities for businesses have gradually decreased, and each month the purchasing power of the majority of people declines. Taking this situation into account, as the Sales Startup Booster, we have designed a new plan to increase the sale of goods and services in online and offline stores.</h4>\n<h4>This plan, using tested and researched marketing and sales ideas, helps sellers increase their sales. Additionally, we intend to bring offline sellers into the online market to boost sales and provide innovative services. This system helps small and large stores, but larger stores like Digikala, Snapp, Torob, and BIZPAL will welcome it more.</h4>\n<h4>For shipping goods in cities, we can use our own dedicated ride-hailing and taxi software, or we can rely on services like Tapsi and Snapp, which makes our system more flexible. As I said, some offline sellers will also strengthen their sales and services. Even companies that offer non-retail services, like Alibaba for selling tickets and hotel reservations, can use our system and help increase their sales.</h4>\n<h4>This system generally helps businesses with sales and does not extensively use artificial intelligence, but in later stages, our plans include using AI. Initially, we can start by launching a website, even without a large programming team. By creating a strong marketing force, we can compete with competitors who are already in the market. In the following explanations about your sales system, I can provide some ideas and solutions to increase sales and boost businesses:</h4>\n<h4>1. Advertising and Marketing: Using various advertising methods such as social media advertising, search engine advertising, sending promotional emails, and local advertising can help attract new customers and increase your sales.</h4>\n<h4>2. Creating Discounts and Special Offers: Offering discounts, special offers, and discount packages to customers can encourage them to make a purchase. Also, creating loyalty programs and rewards for existing customers can help retain them and encourage repeat purchases.</h4>\n<h4>3. Improving Customer Experience: Creating a positive and attractive customer experience by offering distinctive and quality services can attract new customers and retain existing ones. Providing strong after-sales service and customer support can play an important role in creating customer satisfaction.</h4>\n<h4>4. Collaborating with Other Businesses: Establishing partnerships with related businesses can help increase sales and attract new customers. For example, you can collaborate with a delivery company to offer faster and more efficient shipping.</h4>\n<h4>5. Improving Online Display: If you use an online store, ensure that your website and user interface are efficient and easy to use. Providing complete images and descriptions of your products and services can help customers make the best decisions.</h4>\n<h4>6. Researching Customers and Market: Researching customer needs and preferences, as well as market analysis, can help you</h4>\nsrc=\"/media/booster-sale-s.jpg\"Invitation to Collaborate – Amazing Sales Startup Booster – Mehrdad Website\n<h3>For more information, please contact us</h3>\n<p>🌐 Telegram Channel<br />\n<a href=\"https://t.me/startup_mt\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.me/startup_mt</a></p>\n<h2>Here we have explained various types of collaboration and startup investments …<br />\n</h2>\n<h4>1. Human Capital: <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d9%81%d8%b1%d8%b5%d8%aa-%d9%87%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%b3%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%87-%da%af%d8%b0%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d9%86%d8%b1%d9%85-%d8%a7%d9%81%d8%b2%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d9%87%d8%a7%db%8c-%d9%85%d8%a7/\" rel=\"noopener\">Investment</a> in the founding team and key individuals <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%af%d8%b9%d9%88%d8%aa-%d8%a8%d9%87-%d9%87%d9%85%da%a9%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c-%d9%be%d8%b1%d9%88%da%98%d9%87-%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%aa-%d8%a2%d9%be%db%8c/\" rel=\"noopener\">Startup</a>.<br />\n2. Financial Capital: <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%ac%d8%b0%d8%a8-%d8%b3%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%87-%da%af%d8%b0%d8%a7%d8%b1-%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%b3%db%8c%d8%b3%d8%aa%d9%85-%d9%85%d8%a7%d9%84%db%8c-%d9%88-%d8%af%d9%88-%d8%aa%d8%a8/\" rel=\"noopener\">Investment</a> of cash and financial resources into the <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d8%b7%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%ad%db%8c-%d8%b3%db%8c%d8%b3%d8%aa%d9%85-%d8%ad%d9%85%d9%84-%d9%88-%d9%86%d9%82%d9%84-%d9%86%d9%88%db%8c%d9%86/\" rel=\"noopener\">startup</a> to cover expenses and growth.<br />\n3. Risk Capital: <a href=\"https://mehrdad.ir/%d9%81%d8%b1%d8%b5%d8%aa-%d9%87%d8%a7%db%8c-%d8%b3%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%db%8c%d9%87-%da%g%a7%d8%b0%d8%a7%d8%b1%db%8c-%d9%86%d8%b1%d9%85-%d8%a7%d9%81